  <section class="dice-demo-page">
    <header class="dice-demo-header">
      <div class="dice-demo-kicker">DUNGEONS &amp; DRAGONS · TOOLKIT</div>
      <h1>Dice Roller</h1>
      <p>O interfață demonstrativă. Modulul de aruncare poate fi declanșat și de butoane din alte secțiuni ale aplicației.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="dice-builder" aria-labelledby="dice-builder-title">
      <div class="dice-builder-heading">
        <div>
          <div class="dice-section-kicker">ROLL CONFIGURATION</div>
          <h2 id="dice-builder-title">Configurează aruncarea</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="dice-selected-summary" aria-live="polite">
          <span class="dice-summary-label">DICE</span>
          <strong data-dice-notation>—</strong>
          <span class="dice-summary-count" data-dice-count>0 / 100</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dice-type-grid" aria-label="Adaugă câte un zar">
        <button class="dice-type-button" type="button" data-add-die="4" aria-label="Adaugă un zar d4">
          <span class="dice-type-shape dice-type-shape--d4">d4</span>
          <span class="dice-type-name">D4</span>
          <span class="dice-type-count" data-count-for="4">0</span>
        </button>
        <button class="dice-type-button" type="button" data-add-die="6" aria-label="Adaugă un zar d6">
          <span class="dice-type-shape dice-type-shape--d6">d6</span>
          <span class="dice-type-name">D6</span>
          <span class="dice-type-count" data-count-for="6">0</span>
        </button>
        <button class="dice-type-button" type="button" data-add-die="8" aria-label="Adaugă un zar d8">
          <span class="dice-type-shape dice-type-shape--d8">d8</span>
          <span class="dice-type-name">D8</span>
          <span class="dice-type-count" data-count-for="8">0</span>
        </button>
        <button class="dice-type-button" type="button" data-add-die="10" aria-label="Adaugă un zar d10">
          <span class="dice-type-shape dice-type-shape--d10">d10</span>
          <span class="dice-type-name">D10</span>
          <span class="dice-type-count" data-count-for="10">0</span>
        </button>
        <button class="dice-type-button" type="button" data-add-die="12" aria-label="Adaugă un zar d12">
          <span class="dice-type-shape dice-type-shape--d12">d12</span>
          <span class="dice-type-name">D12</span>
          <span class="dice-type-count" data-count-for="12">0</span>
        </button>
        <button class="dice-type-button" type="button" data-add-die="20" aria-label="Adaugă un zar d20">
          <span class="dice-type-shape dice-type-shape--d20">d20</span>
          <span class="dice-type-name">D20</span>
          <span class="dice-type-count" data-count-for="20">0</span>
        </button>
        <button class="dice-type-button" type="button" data-add-die="100" aria-label="Adaugă un zar d100">
          <span class="dice-type-shape dice-type-shape--d100">d100</span>
          <span class="dice-type-name">D100</span>
          <span class="dice-type-count" data-count-for="100">0</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="dice-mode-row" aria-label="Modul aruncării">
        <div class="dice-mode-copy">
          <span>Roll mode</span>
          <small>Click din nou pe modul activ pentru a reveni la aruncarea normală.</small>
        </div>
        <div class="dice-mode-buttons">
          <button class="dice-mode-button dice-mode-button--advantage" type="button" data-roll-mode="advantage" aria-pressed="false">
            <span class="dice-mode-button__mark" aria-hidden="true">↑</span>
            <span class="dice-mode-button__copy"><strong>Advantage</strong><small>Keep higher</small></span>
          </button>
          <button class="dice-mode-button dice-mode-button--disadvantage" type="button" data-roll-mode="disadvantage" aria-pressed="false">
            <span class="dice-mode-button__mark" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
            <span class="dice-mode-button__copy"><strong>Disadvantage</strong><small>Keep lower</small></span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <span class="dice-mode-state" data-mode-description aria-live="polite">Normal roll · un singur set de zaruri</span>
      </div>

      <div class="dice-modifier-grid">
        <label class="dice-field" for="dice-per-die-modifier">
          <span>Modifier / die</span>
          <small>Aplicat separat fiecărui zar</small>
          <input id="dice-per-die-modifier" name="perDieModifier" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="-99" max="99" step="1" value="0">
        </label>
        <label class="dice-field" for="dice-total-modifier">
          <span>Total modifier</span>
          <small>Aplicat o singură dată la sumă</small>
          <input id="dice-total-modifier" name="totalModifier" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="-99" max="99" step="1" value="0">
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="dice-builder-footer">
        <p class="dice-builder-note" data-dice-builder-message>Apasă un tip de zar pentru a-l adăuga în aruncare.</p>
        <div class="dice-builder-actions">
          <button class="dice-button dice-button--quiet" type="button" data-clear-dice>Clear</button>
          <button class="dice-button dice-button--primary" type="button" data-confirm-dice disabled>Roll dice <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dice-demo-notes" aria-label="Note despre integrare">
      <div class="dice-demo-note-mark">+</div>
      <div>
        <h2>Un singur motor, mai multe triggere</h2>
        <p>Alte butoane pot apela <code>window.DNDice.roll("1d20", { mode: "advantage", perDieModifier: 4 })</code> sau pot folosi atributele <code>data-dnd-roll</code> și <code>data-dnd-mode</code>. În avantaj/dezavantaj se generează două valori pentru fiecare zar; după stabilizare, valorile alese sunt reunite în panoul final, iar celălalt panou dispare rapid.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="dice-demo-footer">D&D CHARACTER TOOLKIT <span>·</span> DICE ENGINE DEMO</footer>
  </section>
